# Picstome external API v1
#
# VSCode REST Client (humao.rest-client) collection.
# 1. Start the app: php artisan serve
# 2. Seed the demo gallery: php artisan db:seed --class=ExternalDemoSeeder
# 3. Run "Start authorization" in a browser, log in as desktop@test.com / password
# 4. Copy the `code` query parameter from the picstome:// redirect into @code below.
#
# The same contract is documented in GitHub issue #288 (backend source of truth).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@clientName = picstome-sync
@nonce = 0123456789012345678901234567890123456789012
@gallery = paste-gallery-ulid-here
@code = paste-one-time-code-here
@token = paste-plain-text-token-here
@photoId = 1

### Start authorization (open in a browser, not with REST Client)
# Redirects to picstome://auth?code=...&state=... after login + consent.
GET {{baseUrl}}/authorize?nonce={{nonce}}&client_name={{clientName}}

### Exchange the one-time code for a Sanctum token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tokens/exchange
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "code": "{{code}}",
    "client_name": "{{clientName}}"
}

### Connected account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Galleries of the current team (paginated, optional name search)
# Response: { data: [...], links: {...}, meta: { current_page, per_page, total, last_page } }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/galleries?search=&per_page=25&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Manifest (core sync; `since` is accepted but ignored in v1)
# Each photo includes `favorited_at`, `is_favorite` and the photographer-only
# `rating` (1-5 or null). See docs/photo-ratings.md.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/manifest?gallery={{gallery}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Upload a photo (multipart)
# `hash` is optional and ignored; the server recomputes sha256.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----PicstomeBoundary

------PicstomeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="gallery_id"

{{gallery}}
------PicstomeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="filename"

uploaded-from-rest-client.jpg
------PicstomeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="uploaded-from-rest-client.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/photo.jpg
------PicstomeBoundary--

### Delete photos (only after explicit confirmation in the client)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "gallery_id": "{{gallery}}",
    "photo_ids": [{{photoId}}]
}

### Revoke the current token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tokens/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
